    "title": "Man convicted of killing pregnant wife and her unborn child in 2018 in El Monte - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorials ,\n28 minutes ago POMONA – A man was convicted Wednesday of murdering his pregnant wife and her unborn child in El Monte just over seven years ago. The Pomona jury deliberated about 1 1/2 days before finding Octavio Curiel Martinez, now 43, guilty of first-degree murder for the Aug. 29, 2018, shooting of his wife, Ana Maria Nuñez, who was about six months pregnant, and her fetus. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
